-- הסכם קיבוצי — השלמה ותיקון של ההסכמות אליהן הגיעו הצדדים בהסכם הכולל
-- (29.2.2012), "הסכם ההשלמה": completes and amends the Ofek Hadash base
-- agreement of 25.12.2008. Part A: who it covers, when it starts and ends,
-- and the base agreement's definitions. Part B (§§5–87): the amendments to
-- the base agreement — each written here as the new rule, with the day it
-- takes effect where the text gives one, importing the base sections it
-- builds on (`base-agreement-<N>`) and never re-encoding a clause it
-- replaces. Part C: the cost of the framework agreement of 12.1.2011 and of
-- the erosion claims — the 3.5% rise of the salary to convert, the 2011
-- erosion supplement for teachers off the reform, the end of the erosion
-- checks, and the 2012–2013 allocations (§92). Part D: deducting
-- overpayments made by conversions. Part E: exhaustion of claims.
--
-- The annexes the agreement names (work-week tables, salary tables, the
-- updated tables of §92) are not in the corpus (MMS-116): what the text
-- says of one is a named input here. Where the text leaves an annex's
-- number blank, the finding says so.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-4`
IMPORT `base-agreement-7`
IMPORT `base-agreement-15`
IMPORT `base-agreement-17`
IMPORT `base-agreement-23`
IMPORT `base-agreement-24`
IMPORT `base-agreement-30`
IMPORT `base-agreement-36`
IMPORT `base-agreement-44`
IMPORT `base-agreement-63`
IMPORT `base-agreement-67`
IMPORT `base-agreement-90`
IMPORT `base-agreement-92`
IMPORT `base-agreement-117`
IMPORT `base-agreement-124`
IMPORT `base-agreement-140`
IMPORT `base-agreement-144`
IMPORT `base-agreement-153`
IMPORT `base-agreement-155`

-- The day the agreement was signed.
`the signing of the completion agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 29 2 2012

-- A school year named by the calendar year it opens in (convention
-- dates.school-year: it opens on 1 September). תשס"ח opens in 2007, תשס"ט in
-- 2008, תש"ע in 2009, תשע"א in 2010, תשע"ב in 2011, תשע"ג in 2012, תשע"ד in
-- 2013.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the school year opening in` y IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 y

-- What the parties must, may or may not do under this agreement.
DECLARE `completion agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `approve completion hours for a teacher who meets §33א(א) and wants them`
    `give the completion-hours approval in writing to the teacher and the principal`
    `stop the additional employment`
    `act to recognise the cluster-management allowance as a fixed supplement for the pensions law`
    `continue negotiating the reform for the further populations of §155(ב)`
    `send written notice of the overpayment a month before the deduction`
    `negotiate further on a matter this agreement settles`
    `raise a claim on the erosion of teachers' pay against engineers' pay`

§ `הסכם ההשלמה — 29.2.2012`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (18.11.2013); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing, encoded above as `the signing of the completion agreement`.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the base agreement of 25.12.2008 and its short names ("ההסכם הכולל", "רפורמת אופק חדש"); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the parties went on negotiating to complete and amend the base agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the negotiation under §155(א) of the base agreement on the framework agreement of 12.1.2011; §92 carries its result.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the negotiation ending the engineers' erosion claims; §§91 and 94 carry its result.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the parties anchor what they agreed in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§ `א. כללי`

§§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

DECLARE `part of the completion agreement` IS ONE OF
    `its preamble`
    `its body`
    `one of its annexes`

@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the completion agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the completion agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the completion agreement` `its preamble` AND `binds as the completion agreement` `one of its annexes`

§§ `2 לשון`

DECLARE `grammatical form` IS ONE OF `the masculine`, `the feminine`, `the singular`, `the plural`

-- "unless expressly stated otherwise": a word written in one form reads in
-- every other.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `grammatical form`, `read in` IS A `grammatical form`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the completion agreement reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word of the completion agreement reads in another form` `the masculine` `the feminine` FALSE

§§ `3 תחולה, תחילה ותוקף`

DECLARE `kind of workplace` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten`
    `a primary school`
    `a junior high school`
    `a special-education school`
    `a special-education class in a primary or junior high school`
    `a regional support centre (Matia)`
    `a therapeutic centre`
    `a Pais cluster`
    `a teachers' centre (Pisga)`
    `an agricultural farm`
    `a marine centre`
    `a kindergarten cluster`
    `another workplace`

@desc An employee, as far as §3 asks who the agreement covers.
DECLARE `employee under the completion agreement` HAS
    `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `in the civil service`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    workplace                                  IS A `kind of workplace`

-- (ב): from תשע"ב the base agreement and this one reach farms, marine
-- centres and kindergarten clusters too.
GIVEN w IS A `kind of workplace`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a workplace §3 covers` w d IF
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `another workplace` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `an agricultural farm` THEN d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2011)
    WHEN `a marine centre` THEN d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2011)
    WHEN `a kindergarten cluster` THEN d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2011)
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- (א)–(ב): teaching employees in the civil service at the workplaces listed.
-- (ג): subject to §§91 and 92, which reach every teaching employee in the
-- civil service wherever employed (§§91(ב), 92(ד)).
@ref akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN e IS AN `employee under the completion agreement`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the completion agreement` e d IF
        e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale`
    AND e's `in the civil service`
    AND `a workplace §3 covers` (e's workplace) d

GIVEN e IS AN `employee under the completion agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by §§91 and 92` e IF
    e's `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` AND e's `in the civil service`

`a teacher on an agricultural farm` MEANS
    `employee under the completion agreement` WITH
        `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` IS TRUE
        `in the civil service`                    IS TRUE
        workplace                                 IS `an agricultural farm`
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the completion agreement` `a teacher on an agricultural farm` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011)
#ASSERT `covered by the completion agreement` `a teacher on an agricultural farm` (`the school year opening in` 2011)

-- (ד): it starts when the base agreement does (§4 there), save a clause
-- that gives its own start.
@ref akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN `the clause's own start` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `a clause of the completion agreement starts on` `the clause's own start` IS
    `a provision starts on` `the clause's own start`

#ASSERT `a clause of the completion agreement starts on` NOTHING EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2008

-- (ה): its fixed term lasts until the reform is complete under the base
-- agreement, "דהיינו עד 1.9.2013" — the base agreement's own end (§4(ב)).
@ref akn:art_3__para_e
`the completion agreement's fixed term ends on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013

#ASSERT `the completion agreement's fixed term ends on` EQUALS `the fixed term ends on`

§§ `4 הגדרות`

@ref akn:art_4/p1
`the definitions of §7 of the base agreement apply here, as §5 amends them` MEANS TRUE

§ `ב. תיקונים, שינויים ותוספות להסכם הכולל`

§§ `5 תיקון סעיף 7 להסכם הכולל`

-- akn:art_5/p1 The lead-in ("in §7 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ג).

-- (א): in §7(ט)(2)'s second paragraph, "years of seniority" becomes "years
-- of employment in teaching": what (2) counts is years of employment in
-- teaching, without the internship year and without IDF or national
-- service in teaching.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a
GIVEN `years of employment in teaching` IS A NUMBER, `of them the internship year` IS A NUMBER, `of them IDF or national service in teaching` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the years §7(ט)(2) counts` `years of employment in teaching` `of them the internship year` `of them IDF or national service in teaching` IS
    `not below zero` (`years of employment in teaching` MINUS `of them the internship year` MINUS `of them IDF or national service in teaching`)

#ASSERT `the years §7(ט)(2) counts` 5 1 2 EQUALS 2

-- akn:art_5__para_b Renumbers §7(טז) as (טו); no rule.

-- (ג): §7(יז), the definition of "גננת", is struck out — the definition
-- F-ofek-hadash-base-7-a found to name only who is NOT one — and three
-- definitions take its place. (טז) an existing kindergarten teacher: one
-- who, on the eve of her own move to the reform, met one of the conditions
-- of §7(ט)(1)(א), (ט)(1)(ב) and (ט)(2). Unlike an existing teacher under
-- (ט)(1), the condition is asked on the eve of the move alone. (יז) a new
-- kindergarten teacher: one who is not existing.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing kindergarten teacher` h IF
        `meets a condition of 7(ט)(1)` (h's `on the eve of the move to the reform`)
    OR  `existing under 7(ט)(2)` h

GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new kindergarten teacher` h IF
    NOT `an existing kindergarten teacher` h

-- (יח) "סטאטוס": a mother teacher, a homeroom teacher, a homeroom teacher
-- and mother, or a teacher who is none of them ("a regular teacher") — the
-- four statuses §44(ג) sets Y by.
`the statuses §7(יח) defines` MEANS
    LIST `a mother teacher`, `a homeroom teacher`, `a homeroom teacher and mother`, `a regular teacher`

`a kindergarten teacher who joined after the signing of the base agreement` MEANS
    `teacher's history` WITH
        `on the eve of the signing`                 IS `neither`
        `on the eve of the move to the reform`      IS `taught or managed a school for the State, the year recognised as seniority for pay`
        `began in the civil service in 5768 or later` IS FALSE
        `years of teaching elsewhere recognised for seniority` IS 0
#ASSERT `an existing kindergarten teacher` `a kindergarten teacher who joined after the signing of the base agreement`
#ASSERT NOT `an existing teacher` `a kindergarten teacher who joined after the signing of the base agreement`

§§ `6 החלפת סעיף 12 להסכם הכולל`

@desc A teaching employee who starts in another or a further institution, as far as the new §12 asks.
DECLARE `teacher moving institution` HAS
    `worked on the reform's terms in an institution`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the new institution has moved to the reform`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `already employed there off the reform alongside`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed there, not on the reform's terms, alongside the reform employment, and continuing there (12(ב))
    `a kindergarten teacher`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the school year the new employment began in`            IS A NUMBER  @desc the calendar year the school year opens in

DECLARE `terms in the new institution` IS ONE OF
    `on the reform's terms`
    `off the reform's terms`

-- (א): employed in the new institution on the reform's terms even if it has
-- not moved; (ב): save where he was already employed there off the reform
-- alongside, who stays off the reform there while it has not moved; (ג):
-- (א) reaches a kindergarten teacher from תשע"ב; (ד): one who started in
-- another kindergarten in תש"ע or תשע"א is off the reform there while it
-- has not moved.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p2
GIVEN t IS A `teacher moving institution`
GIVETH A `terms in the new institution`
DECIDE `the terms in the new institution` t IS
    BRANCH
        IF t's `the new institution has moved to the reform` THEN `on the reform's terms`
        IF NOT t's `worked on the reform's terms in an institution` THEN `off the reform's terms`
        IF t's `already employed there off the reform alongside` THEN `off the reform's terms`
        IF t's `a kindergarten teacher` AND t's `the school year the new employment began in` LESS THAN 2011 THEN `off the reform's terms`
        OTHERWISE `on the reform's terms`

`a kindergarten teacher starting in a second kindergarten in תשע"א` MEANS
    `teacher moving institution` WITH
        `worked on the reform's terms in an institution`   IS TRUE
        `the new institution has moved to the reform`     IS FALSE
        `already employed there off the reform alongside` IS FALSE
        `a kindergarten teacher`                          IS TRUE
        `the school year the new employment began in`     IS 2010
#ASSERT `the terms in the new institution` `a kindergarten teacher starting in a second kindergarten in תשע"א` EQUALS `off the reform's terms`
`a kindergarten teacher starting in a second kindergarten in תשע"ב` MEANS
    `teacher moving institution` WITH
        `worked on the reform's terms in an institution`   IS TRUE
        `the new institution has moved to the reform`     IS FALSE
        `already employed there off the reform alongside` IS FALSE
        `a kindergarten teacher`                          IS TRUE
        `the school year the new employment began in`     IS 2011
#ASSERT `the terms in the new institution` `a kindergarten teacher starting in a second kindergarten in תשע"ב` EQUALS `on the reform's terms`

-- (ג), its second sentence: in a kindergarten not yet moved, her position
-- is her hours with the children by the pre-reform week over her position
-- base under the reform. No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
GIVEN `hours with the children by the pre-reform week` IS A NUMBER, `her position base under the reform` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher's position in a kindergarten not yet moved` `hours with the children by the pre-reform week` `her position base under the reform` IS
    `hours with the children by the pre-reform week` DIVIDED BY `her position base under the reform`

-- (ג), its third sentence: subject to the system's needs she may complete
-- the hours missing to her base with hours with the children; and such
-- employment is no ground for a claim of harm to the commitment to a scope
-- of employment.
GIVEN `her position base under the reform` IS A NUMBER, `her hours` IS A NUMBER, `the system needs the hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours she may complete` `her position base under the reform` `her hours` `the system needs the hours` IS
    IF `the system needs the hours` THEN `not below zero` (`her position base under the reform` MINUS `her hours`) ELSE 0

`employment under the new §12(ג) is a ground for a claim of harm to the scope of employment` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `a kindergarten teacher's position in a kindergarten not yet moved` 26 30.4 GREATER THAN 0.85

§§ `7 החלפת סעיף 13 להסכם הכולל — מילוי מקום ברפורמה`

@desc A substitute, as far as the new §13 asks.
DECLARE `substitute under the new §13` HAS
    `placed in weekly hours in place of another teacher` IS A BOOLEAN @desc as in a work accident, maternity leave, reserve duty, a stoppage, unpaid leave or a sabbatical (13(ב))
    `also employed in teaching by the Ministry, not as a substitute` IS A BOOLEAN
    `that employment is on the reform's terms`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the replaced teacher is on the reform's terms`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `an existing teacher under §7(ט)(2)`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `academic`                                             IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `how a substitute is employed and paid` IS ONE OF
    `frontal hours only, at the substitute-hour value of his own terms`
    `frontal hours only, at the substitute-hour value of the rules on the eve of the reform`
    `his reform position is enlarged`
    `his position off the reform is enlarged`
    `his pay is converted to the reform's and he is employed on its terms`
    `paid as a teacher off the reform`
    `on the reform's terms, his pay converted`
    `on the reform's terms, paid as a new teacher`

-- (א): not placed in weekly hours — frontal hours only; (1) one also
-- teaching for the Ministry is paid the substitute hour of his own terms,
-- (2) one who is not, by the rules on the eve of the reform. (ב): placed in
-- weekly hours — (1) a Ministry teacher on the reform: his reform position
-- grows; (2) one off it: as the replaced teacher was, (א) off the reform his
-- position off it grows, (ב) on it his pay is converted; (3) one not
-- teaching for the Ministry: (א) off the reform, paid as one off it, (ב) on
-- it, on the reform's terms — (1) converted if an existing teacher by
-- §7(ט)(2), (2) else as a new teacher.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN s IS A `substitute under the new §13`
GIVETH A `how a substitute is employed and paid`
DECIDE `how the substitute is employed` s IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT s's `placed in weekly hours in place of another teacher`
        THEN (IF s's `also employed in teaching by the Ministry, not as a substitute`
              THEN `frontal hours only, at the substitute-hour value of his own terms`
              ELSE `frontal hours only, at the substitute-hour value of the rules on the eve of the reform`)
        IF s's `also employed in teaching by the Ministry, not as a substitute`
        THEN (IF s's `that employment is on the reform's terms`
              THEN `his reform position is enlarged`
              ELSE (IF s's `the replaced teacher is on the reform's terms`
                    THEN `his pay is converted to the reform's and he is employed on its terms`
                    ELSE `his position off the reform is enlarged`))
        IF NOT s's `the replaced teacher is on the reform's terms` THEN `paid as a teacher off the reform`
        IF s's `an existing teacher under §7(ט)(2)` THEN `on the reform's terms, his pay converted`
        OTHERWISE `on the reform's terms, paid as a new teacher`

-- (ב)(2)(ב), its second sentence: no later conversion, save where within 4
-- months of starting he completed a degree, a non-academic level or a
-- training allowance — then his pay is converted again with it, from the
-- day of the entitlement. "תוך 4 חודשים" takes the fourth month in
-- (convention dates.end).
@ref akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN `months from starting to the entitlement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a substitute's pay is converted again` `months from starting to the entitlement` IF
    `months from starting to the entitlement` AT MOST 4

-- (ב)(2)(ג): a non-academic one is employed on the reform's terms of a
-- non-academic teacher, exceptionally without the commitment to complete an
-- academic education — for the substitution only.
GIVEN `the employment is the substitution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-academic substitute must commit to an academic education` `the employment is the substitution` IF
    NOT `the employment is the substitution`

`an outside existing teacher replacing one on the reform` MEANS
    `substitute under the new §13` WITH
        `placed in weekly hours in place of another teacher` IS TRUE
        `also employed in teaching by the Ministry, not as a substitute` IS FALSE
        `that employment is on the reform's terms`             IS FALSE
        `the replaced teacher is on the reform's terms`        IS TRUE
        `an existing teacher under §7(ט)(2)`                   IS TRUE
        `academic`                                             IS TRUE
#ASSERT `how the substitute is employed` `an outside existing teacher replacing one on the reform` EQUALS `on the reform's terms, his pay converted`
#ASSERT `a substitute's pay is converted again` 4
#ASSERT NOT `a non-academic substitute must commit to an academic education` TRUE

-- (ג): the substitution rules (ג) does not change go on, as they are from
-- time to time and with their standing unchanged.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c
`the substitution rules §13 does not change go on` MEANS TRUE

§§ `8 תיקון סעיף 15 להסכם הכולל`

-- The end of §15(ה): the stay hours serve, among other things, the grade
-- coordinator's role.
@ref akn:art_8/p1
GIVEN `the role` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stay hours serve the role` `the role` IF
    `the role` EQUALS "ממונה שכבה"

#ASSERT `the stay hours serve the role` "ממונה שכבה"

§§ `9 אורך שעה פרטנית ושעת שהיה`

-- §§15(ו) and 17(ו): an individual hour and a stay hour last as long as a
-- frontal lesson by the school's timetable; break time is no stay hour.
@ref akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN `minutes of a frontal lesson by the timetable` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `minutes of an individual or stay hour` `minutes of a frontal lesson by the timetable` IS
    `minutes of a frontal lesson by the timetable`

`break time counts as stay hours` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `minutes of an individual or stay hour` 45 EQUALS 45

§§ `10 מורה משלב/ת — מורה/ת שילוב`

-- akn:art_10__para_a Renames "מורה משלב/ת" as "מורה/ת שילוב" in §§19, 20, 27(ה), 31(א)(1), 33(ב)(2) and 39(א)(4); a word, no rule.
-- akn:art_10__para_b Renames "מורות משלבות" as "מורי/ות שילוב" in §27(ח); a word, no rule.

§§ `11 תיקון סעיף 19 להסכם הכולל`

-- akn:art_11/p1 The lead-in ("in §19 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ד).

-- (א)–(ב): the weeks §19 sets for an integration teacher and a
-- special-education teacher are those of a full position.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_b
`the weeks of §19 are of a full position` MEANS TRUE

-- (ג): §19(ג): the hours of travel from one school to another count as stay
-- hours.
@ref akn:art_11__para_c
GIVEN w IS A `work week`, `hours of travel between schools` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `an integration teacher's week counting travel` w `hours of travel between schools` IS
    `a week of` (w's `frontal hours`) (w's `individual hours`) (w's `stay hours` PLUS `hours of travel between schools`)

#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`an integration teacher's week counting travel` (`a week of` 20 4 6) 2) EQUALS 32

-- (ד): the tables of an integration teacher's week are annexed "כנספחים
-- ______" — the annex is not named (F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-h); an input.
@ref akn:art_11__para_d
ASSUME `the integration teacher's week tables` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO `work week`

§§ `12 תיקון סעיף 20`

-- §20 reaches paramedical teaching employees in kindergartens too.
@ref akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN `in a paramedical role` IS A BOOLEAN, `in a kindergarten` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `on the paramedical week of §20` `in a paramedical role` `in a kindergarten` IF
    `in a paramedical role`

