§§ `13 מבנה שבוע עבודה לממונה שכבה בבית ספר יסודי לחינוך מיוחד`

-- §21(ב): a grade coordinator in a primary special-education school divides
-- his week as §15(ה) does.
@ref akn:art_13/p1
GIVEN classes IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a grade coordinator's week in a primary special-education school` classes IS
    `a primary grade coordinator's week` classes

§§ `14 מבנה שבוע עבודה לממונה שכבה בבית ספר רב-שלבי לחינוך מיוחד`

-- §22(ד): a grade coordinator of grades 7 to 12 in a multi-stage
-- special-education school divides his week as §17(ה) does; for grades 10
-- and up, subject to the wages commissioner's letter of 25.12.08 (not in
-- the corpus; an input).
@ref akn:art_14/p1
ASSUME `what the wages commissioner's letter of 25.12.08 allows for grades 10 and up` IS A FUNCTION FROM `work week` TO `work week`

GIVEN classes IS A NUMBER, `coordinates grades 10 and up` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a grade coordinator's week in a multi-stage special-education school` classes `coordinates grades 10 and up` IS
    IF `coordinates grades 10 and up`
    THEN `what the wages commissioner's letter of 25.12.08 allows for grades 10 and up` (`a junior-high grade coordinator's week` classes)
    ELSE `a junior-high grade coordinator's week` classes

§§ `15 תיקון סעיף 23 להסכם הכולל — פיצוי מעבר מחטיבת ביניים ליסודי`

-- akn:art_15/p1 The lead-in ("in §23 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ב).

-- (ב): §23(ד): the supplement reaches also a permanent teacher who moved to
-- the primary week (for the Ministry's demand or the school's closing, as
-- (א)) in the year he moved to the reform — who was never on the reform's
-- junior-high week.
@ref akn:art_15__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `moved teacher`, `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the transfer compensation` t `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform` IF
        `entitled to the section 23 supplement` t
    OR  (    t's `permanent`
         AND `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform`
         AND NOT t's cause EQUALS `another cause`)

-- (א): the end of §23(א): the supplement is computed only on the share of
-- the position he works on the primary week, as it is from time to time,
-- and is called "פיצוי מעבר מחטיבת ביניים ליסודי". §23(א) still multiplies
-- by his junior-high share on the eve of the move. F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-d: the
-- clause now names two shares. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.every-word): both bind — the lesser of the two.
@ref akn:art_15__para_a
GIVEN t IS A `moved teacher`, `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN, `his share on the primary week now` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the junior-high to primary transfer compensation` t `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform` `his share on the primary week now` IS
    IF `entitled to the transfer compensation` t `moved to the primary week in the year he moved to the reform`
    THEN `the section 23 rate` TIMES t's `combined salary` TIMES min (t's `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move`) `his share on the primary week now`
    ELSE 0

`a teacher half in the junior high on the eve, now full on the primary week` MEANS
    `moved teacher` WITH
        `permanent`                            IS TRUE
        `was on the reform's junior-high week` IS TRUE
        cause                                  IS `the closing of the school`
        `junior-high position fraction on the eve of the move` IS 0.5
        `combined salary`                      IS 10000

-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-d's evidence: the share on the eve and the share now give
-- different amounts for the same teacher.
`amended §23 gives two amounts for one teacher` MEANS
    NOT (`the section 23 rate` TIMES 10000 TIMES 0.5 EQUALS `the section 23 rate` TIMES 10000 TIMES 1)
#ASSERT `amended §23 gives two amounts for one teacher`
#ASSERT `the junior-high to primary transfer compensation` `a teacher half in the junior high on the eve, now full on the primary week` FALSE 1 EQUALS 625

§§ `16 תיקון סעיפים 24 ו-27 להסכם הכולל — מורה אם`

`1 September 2011` MEANS `the school year opening in` 2011

-- (א), (ד): from 1.9.2011 a mother teacher in a full position works one
-- frontal hour and one stay hour a week less, in place of half an hour of
-- stay a day (2.5 weekly). Before it, §24 as the base agreement has it.
@ref akn:art_16__para_a akn:art_16__para_d
GIVEN w IS A `work week`, `a mother teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a mother teacher's week on` w `a mother teacher` `position fraction` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `1 September 2011` AND `a mother teacher` AND `position fraction` EQUALS 1
    THEN `a week of` (w's `frontal hours` MINUS 1) (w's `individual hours`) (w's `stay hours` MINUS 1)
    ELSE `a mother teacher's week` w `a mother teacher` `position fraction`

#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a mother teacher's week on` (`a week of` 26 5 5) TRUE 1 `1 September 2011`) EQUALS 34
#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a mother teacher's week on` (`a week of` 26 5 5) TRUE 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2011)) EQUALS 33.5

-- (ב): §24(ב): a mother teacher who, by agreement and for the system's
-- needs, does not take off the frontal hour has her position computed as
-- if she taught one frontal hour more than she does.
@ref akn:art_16__para_b
GIVEN `frontal hours taught` IS A NUMBER, `took off the frontal hour` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours a mother teacher's position is computed on` `frontal hours taught` `took off the frontal hour` IS
    IF `took off the frontal hour` THEN `frontal hours taught` ELSE `frontal hours taught` PLUS 1

#ASSERT `the frontal hours a mother teacher's position is computed on` 26 FALSE EQUALS 27

-- (ג): in §27(ט), the part-time mother's reduction is in frontal and stay
-- hours, by the annexes (an input there).
@ref akn:art_16__para_c
`a part-time mother's reduction is in frontal hours as well as stay hours` MEANS TRUE

§§ `17 תיקון סעיף 27 להסכם הכולל — העסקה במשרה חלקית`

-- akn:art_17/p1 The lead-in ("in §27 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ו).

DECLARE `part-time role` IS ONE OF
    `a paramedical teaching employee`
    `an integration teacher`
    `a teacher of a needed subject with the personnel division's approval`
    `another teacher`

-- (א)–(ב): §27(ז) leaves out the paramedical and integration teachers, and
-- §27(ז1) gives them hours in proportion to the full-position hours of
-- §§19–20, by tables annexed "כנספחים ______" (F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-h); an
-- input. The others stay on §§15–18 and 21–23, by annexes א and ב.
@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b
ASSUME `the part-time tables for paramedical and integration teachers` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO `work week`

GIVEN r IS A `part-time role`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the sections a part-time teacher's full-position hours are taken from` r IS
    IF r EQUALS `a paramedical teaching employee` OR r EQUALS `an integration teacher`
    THEN "19–20"
    ELSE "15–18, 21–23"

-- (ג): §27(ח1): a paramedical or integration teacher below a third of a
-- position, or a teacher of a needed subject below a third by the
-- division's special approval, with three frontal hours or fewer in the
-- school ("single frontal hours"), teaches those hours only — no individual
-- or stay hours there — and the position there is those hours over the
-- position base. No rounding is stated (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_17__para_c
GIVEN r IS A `part-time role`, `position share in the school` IS A NUMBER, `frontal hours in the school` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed in single frontal hours only` r `position share in the school` `frontal hours in the school` IF
        (NOT r EQUALS `another teacher`)
    AND `position share in the school` LESS THAN 1/3
    AND `frontal hours in the school` AT MOST 3

GIVEN `frontal hours in the school` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position of single frontal hours` `frontal hours in the school` `position base` IS
    `frontal hours in the school` DIVIDED BY `position base`

#ASSERT `employed in single frontal hours only` `an integration teacher` 0.1 3
#ASSERT `the position of single frontal hours` 3 30 EQUALS 0.1

-- akn:art_17__para_d Renames the annexes §27(ט) cites ("א' ו-ב'" becomes "א', ב', ג' ו-ג1"); §86 says which annexes are in force.

-- (ה): §27(יא): the age reduction for a part-time position of a third or
-- more is by annexes א and ב (an input there).
@ref akn:art_17__para_e
GIVEN `position share` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the age reduction is by the annexes` `position share` IF
    `position share` AT LEAST 1/3

-- (ו): §27(יב): below a third, the position is computed on a base of 34
-- hours for an existing teacher of 50 to 55 and a new one of 50 and up, and
-- of 32 for an existing teacher of 55 and up. 55 is in the row that opens
-- at it ("55 ומעלה"); under 50 the clause sets no base.
@ref akn:art_17__para_f
GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the position base for age hours below a third` `an existing teacher` age IS
    BRANCH
        IF age LESS THAN 50 THEN NOTHING
        IF `an existing teacher` AND age AT LEAST 55 THEN JUST 32
        OTHERWISE JUST 34

#ASSERT `the position base for age hours below a third` TRUE 55 EQUALS JUST 32
#ASSERT `the position base for age hours below a third` FALSE 58 EQUALS JUST 34
#ASSERT `the position base for age hours below a third` TRUE 49 EQUALS NOTHING

