§§ `20 תיקון סעיף 33 להסכם הכולל — עובד הוראה בכמה בתי ספר`

-- §33(ה): by the personnel division's approval, a teacher in several
-- schools (all primary or all junior high) whose frontal hours together are
-- a full position's but whose weekly hours together, by the week tables,
-- are more than a full position's: his position is the weekly hours over a
-- full position's — above 100%, with no district decision needed. (ו):
-- §33(ד)(2)–(4) apply to him. No rounding is stated (convention
-- rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_20/p1
GIVEN `approved by the personnel division` IS A BOOLEAN, `all the schools of one stage` IS A BOOLEAN, `frontal hours together` IS A NUMBER, `frontal hours of a full position` IS A NUMBER, `weekly hours together` IS A NUMBER, `weekly hours of a full position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the position of a teacher in several schools by §33(ה)` `approved by the personnel division` `all the schools of one stage` `frontal hours together` `frontal hours of a full position` `weekly hours together` `weekly hours of a full position` IS
    IF      `approved by the personnel division`
        AND `all the schools of one stage`
        AND `frontal hours together` EQUALS `frontal hours of a full position`
        AND `weekly hours together` GREATER THAN `weekly hours of a full position`
    THEN JUST (`weekly hours together` DIVIDED BY `weekly hours of a full position`)
    ELSE NOTHING

`§33(ה) needs a district personnel decision` MEANS FALSE
`§33(ד)(2) to (4) apply to a teacher under §33(ה)` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `the position of a teacher in several schools by §33(ה)` TRUE TRUE 26 26 38 36 EQUALS JUST (38 DIVIDED BY 36)

§§ `21 הוספת סעיף 33א להסכם הכולל — שעות השלמה ברפורמה`

-- §33א(א): from תשע"ב, a teacher in several schools under §33(ב) whose
-- position together is below what one school would give for the same
-- frontal hours, (2) on the same week table in all of them.
@ref akn:art_21/p1
GIVEN `position together` IS A NUMBER, `position one school would give for the same frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `on one week table in all the schools` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets §33א(א)` `position together` `position one school would give for the same frontal hours` `on one week table in all the schools` d IF
        d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2011)
    AND `position together` LESS THAN `position one school would give for the same frontal hours`
    AND `on one week table in all the schools`

-- (ב): the Ministry approves individual or stay hours ("completion hours")
-- to one who meets (א) and wants them, so that his position equals one
-- school's; (ז): they are paid as a larger position.
GIVEN `position together` IS A NUMBER, `position one school would give for the same frontal hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position completion hours add` `position together` `position one school would give for the same frontal hours` IS
    `not below zero` (`position one school would give for the same frontal hours` MINUS `position together`)

#ASSERT `the position completion hours add` 0.9 1 EQUALS 0.1

`approving completion hours` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `approve completion hours for a teacher who meets §33א(א) and wants them`
    HENCE (PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
           MUST  `give the completion-hours approval in writing to the teacher and the principal`)

-- (ג): in writing, to the teacher and to the principal of the school where
-- his position is largest, naming the kind and number of hours; (ה): they
-- are done in that school.
GIVEN `position in this school` IS A NUMBER, `positions in all his schools` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school of the completion hours` `position in this school` `positions in all his schools` IF
    all (GIVEN p YIELD p AT MOST `position in this school`) `positions in all his schools`

#ASSERT `the school of the completion hours` 0.5 (LIST 0.5, 0.3, 0.1)

-- (ד): the approval is for one school year and stands though a position
-- changes during it; where the total passes 100%, §33(ד)(2)–(4) apply to
-- the part above it. (ו): approved after the year began, he may with the
-- principal do completion hours for the part of the year before it in
-- which he met (א).
GIVEN `position together with the completion hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the position §33(ד)(2)–(4) apply to` `position together with the completion hours` IS
    `not below zero` (`position together with the completion hours` MINUS 1)

`a completion-hours approval lasts school years` MEANS 1
`completion hours may cover the part of the year before a late approval` MEANS TRUE
`completion hours are paid as a larger position` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `the part of the position §33(ד)(2)–(4) apply to` 1.1 EQUALS 0.1 TIMES 1

§§ `22 תיקון סעיף 36 להסכם הכולל — מורה בעל תואר ראשון`

-- akn:art_22/p1 The lead-in ("in §36(ה) of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ב).

-- (א): §36(ה) is "notwithstanding (ב), (ג) and (ד)", and bars a teacher with
-- a FIRST, second or third degree, without a teaching certificate or
-- certification and with under 25 years of teaching seniority, from
-- promotion until certified. The base agreement's words name only the
-- second degree and the doctorate (F-ofek-hadash-base-36-a); the amendment
-- names the first, from the base agreement's own start (§3(ד)).
@ref akn:art_22__para_a akn:art_22__para_b/p2
GIVEN d IS A `highest degree`, `certified to teach` IS A BOOLEAN, `years of teaching seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred from promotion until certified` d `certified to teach` `years of teaching seniority` IF
    (NOT `certified to teach`) AND `years of teaching seniority` LESS THAN 25

`the amendment bars the first degree §36(ה) passed over` MEANS
        `barred from promotion until certified` `a first degree` FALSE 3
    AND NOT `barred from promotion under 36(ה)` `a first degree` FALSE 3
#ASSERT `the amendment bars the first degree §36(ה) passed over`

-- (ב): the period counted toward promotion runs from his move to the
-- reform, not from the start of his studies, and no longer than one grade's
-- period; the studies count toward §38(א)(2)'s criteria.
@ref akn:art_22__para_b
GIVEN `months from the move to the reform` IS A NUMBER, `months one grade's promotion asks` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months counted toward promotion from the move to the reform` `months from the move to the reform` `months one grade's promotion asks` IS
    min `months from the move to the reform` `months one grade's promotion asks`

#ASSERT `months counted toward promotion from the move to the reform` 40 36 EQUALS 36

§§ `23 ותק 1 בטבלאות השכר`

-- (א): in §§36(א), 46(ג), 146 and 147 "seniority 0" becomes "seniority 1",
