    `years of seniority recognised for his pay on the eve`

§§ `25 הוספת סעיף 38א להסכם הכולל — מעבר לטבלת תואר שני`

-- §38א(א): a teacher entitled to the second-degree table on completing a
-- second degree keeps his seniority and grade there.
@ref akn:art_25/p1
GIVEN p IS A `placement`
GIVETH A `placement`
DECIDE `the placement on completing a second degree` p IS
    `placement` WITH
        table     IS `the second-degree table`
        grade     IS p's grade
        seniority IS p's seniority

-- (ב): not an existing teacher who completed it between 1 September of the
-- year he moved to the reform and 31 December of that school year — §46א
-- (§32 below) applies to him.
GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `completed in the first months of the year of the move` `an existing teacher` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
        `an existing teacher`
    AND `completed on` `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` `the school year he moved in opens in`)
    AND `completed on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 `the school year he moved in opens in`)

GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§38א applies` `an existing teacher` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
    NOT `completed in the first months of the year of the move` `an existing teacher` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`

#ASSERT NOT `§38א applies` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009) 2009
#ASSERT `§38א applies` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010) 2009

§§ `26 הוספת סעיף 38ב להסכם הכולל — מנהל או סגן ראשון שחזר להיות מורה`

-- §38ב(א): placed on the teachers' combined table (by his education) at the
-- grade he had as a teacher on the reform's terms on the eve of his first
-- appointment (for one who was an existing principal or first deputy, by
-- §70א or §97א), plus the grades he advanced in the role, at his whole
-- teaching seniority, the role's included.
@ref akn:art_26/p1
GIVEN `grade as a teacher on the eve of the first appointment` IS A NUMBER, `grades advanced in the role` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the grade of a manager back to teaching` `grade as a teacher on the eve of the first appointment` `grades advanced in the role` IS
    `grade as a teacher on the eve of the first appointment` PLUS `grades advanced in the role`

#ASSERT `the grade of a manager back to teaching` 4 2 EQUALS 6

DECLARE `management role` IS ONE OF
    `principal`
    `first deputy`
    `second deputy`
    `young-division head`
    `kindergarten cluster manager`
    `Pais cluster manager`

@desc A principal or first deputy back to teaching, as far as §38ב(ב)–(ג) ask.
DECLARE `manager back to teaching` HAS
    `last role`                                IS A `management role`
    `years as principal`                       IS A NUMBER @desc in total, continuous or not, on the reform's terms or not
    `years in the roles of §38ב`               IS A NUMBER @desc principal, first deputy, second deputy, young-division head, kindergarten cluster manager and Pais cluster manager, in total
    `permanent appointment as principal`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `was first deputy or in a role paid as one` IS A BOOLEAN

-- (ב)(1)–(3): the salary-protection supplement is for one whose last role
-- was principal with 8 years as principal, or principal with a permanent
-- appointment and 8 years in the roles listed, or first deputy with 8 years
-- in them. (ג)(1)–(3): and for a principal without a permanent appointment,
-- once first deputy (or paid as one), with 8 years in the roles listed. "8
-- שנים ומעלה" takes 8 in.
GIVEN m IS A `manager back to teaching`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under §38ב(ב)` m IF
        (m's `last role` EQUALS `principal` AND m's `years as principal` AT LEAST 8)
    OR  (    m's `last role` EQUALS `principal`
         AND m's `permanent appointment as principal`
         AND m's `years in the roles of §38ב` AT LEAST 8)
    OR  (m's `last role` EQUALS `first deputy` AND m's `years in the roles of §38ב` AT LEAST 8)

GIVEN m IS A `manager back to teaching`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under §38ב(ג)` m IF
        m's `last role` EQUALS `principal`
    AND NOT m's `permanent appointment as principal`
    AND m's `was first deputy or in a role paid as one`
    AND m's `years in the roles of §38ב` AT LEAST 8

-- (ב)(1)–(3): A — the pensionable components of his last pay as manager
-- (also where they are insured in an accrual pension), without the role
-- allowances a teacher has too; under (ג), of his last pay as first deputy
-- or in a role paid as one. B — the same of his pay as a teacher, without
-- its role allowances. C = A − B, where positive.
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary-protection supplement` a b IS
    `not below zero` (a MINUS b)

-- (ב)(4): C goes down at every rise of his combined salary (from seniority
-- or grade, on the same table) by 0.3 × "the sum his combined salary grew
-- by after the rise in GRADE". F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-a: a rise in seniority
-- triggers the reduction, and the measure names the grade. The reading
-- adopted (convention reading.consistent): the rise that triggers it is the
-- rise measured, as §§43, 57 and 58 read it when they add a rise from the
-- school's complexity. Never below nothing (convention
-- amounts.never-negative).
`the share of a rise the supplement goes down by` MEANS 0.3

GIVEN c IS A NUMBER, `the rise in the combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary-protection supplement after a rise` c `the rise in the combined salary` IS
    `not below zero` (c MINUS `the share of a rise the supplement goes down by` TIMES `the rise in the combined salary`)

#ASSERT `the salary-protection supplement after a rise` 1000 400 EQUALS 880
#ASSERT `the salary-protection supplement after a rise` 100 400 EQUALS 0

-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-a's evidence: a rise from seniority alone, on the same
-- grade, is a rise the lead-in names and a rise the measure does not.
GIVEN `from seniority` IS A BOOLEAN, `from grade` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a rise §38ב(ב)(4) reduces at` `from seniority` `from grade` IF
    `from seniority` OR `from grade`

GIVEN `from seniority` IS A BOOLEAN, `from grade` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a rise §38ב(ב)(4) measures` `from seniority` `from grade` IF
    `from grade`

`a seniority rise reduces the supplement by a measure that names only the grade` MEANS
    `a rise §38ב(ב)(4) reduces at` TRUE FALSE AND NOT `a rise §38ב(ב)(4) measures` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `a seniority rise reduces the supplement by a measure that names only the grade`

-- (ב)(5)–(7): C is updated by the rates and on the days the combined salary
-- is; it is salary for every purpose — pensions, provident and study-fund
-- contributions — and the base of no percentage supplement.
DECLARE `purpose of a salary component` IS ONE OF
    `pensions`
    `pension-fund contributions for one insured in an accrual pension`
    `study-fund contributions`
    `the base of percentage supplements`
    `the hour value`
    `severance pay`
    `the Daphna fund`
    `other contributions and deductions usual on the combined salary`

GIVEN p IS A `purpose of a salary component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the salary-protection supplement counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `the base of percentage supplements`

`the salary-protection supplement is updated with the combined salary` MEANS TRUE

-- (ד): the personal supplement of §72 or §99 he had as manager ends when he
-- goes back to teaching.
GIVEN `back to teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the personal supplement of §72 or §99` `back to teaching` IF
    NOT `back to teaching`

`a principal of nine years back to teaching` MEANS
    `manager back to teaching` WITH
        `last role`                                 IS `principal`
        `years as principal`                        IS 9
        `years in the roles of §38ב`                IS 9
        `permanent appointment as principal`        IS FALSE
        `was first deputy or in a role paid as one` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `entitled under §38ב(ב)` `a principal of nine years back to teaching`
#ASSERT NOT `entitled under §38ב(ג)` `a principal of nine years back to teaching`
#ASSERT `the salary-protection supplement` 18000 12000 EQUALS 6000

§§ `27 הוספת סעיף 38ג להסכם הכולל — מי שכיהן בתפקיד ניהולי או כיועץ חינוכי`

-- akn:art_27/p1 The heading of the §38ג the clause adds, printed as the clause's first line; the rules are in the next paragraph.

-- (ג): a "management role" is second deputy and up, kindergarten cluster
-- manager, young-division head, or kindergarten teacher in charge — not
-- principal or first deputy.
DECLARE `role under §38ג` IS ONE OF
    `second deputy or up`
    `a kindergarten cluster manager`
    `a young-division head`
    `a kindergarten teacher in charge`
    `an educational counsellor`
    `a principal or first deputy`
    `a teacher or a complementing kindergarten teacher, with no management role`

GIVEN r IS A `role under §38ג`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a management role under §38ג` r IF
        r EQUALS `second deputy or up`
    OR  r EQUALS `a kindergarten cluster manager`
    OR  r EQUALS `a young-division head`
    OR  r EQUALS `a kindergarten teacher in charge`

-- (א): one who held a management role and moved to another management role,
-- or went back to a post without one ("a teacher or a complementing
-- kindergarten teacher"); (ב): a counsellor who stopped counselling (back to
-- such a post) or moved to a management role — with 8 years in all in
-- management roles, counselling, principal or first deputy, on the reform's
-- terms or not: the salary-protection supplement, by §38ב(ב) with the
-- changes needed. A move from a management role to counselling is neither
-- (א)'s nor (ב)'s; §131א (§72 below) is the clause for it.
@ref akn:art_27/p2
GIVEN `held` IS A `role under §38ג`, `moved to` IS A `role under §38ג`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a move §38ג names` `held` `moved to` IF
        (    `a management role under §38ג` `held`
         AND (   (`a management role under §38ג` `moved to` AND NOT `held` EQUALS `moved to`)
              OR `moved to` EQUALS `a teacher or a complementing kindergarten teacher, with no management role`))
    OR  (    `held` EQUALS `an educational counsellor`
         AND (   `a management role under §38ג` `moved to`
              OR `moved to` EQUALS `a teacher or a complementing kindergarten teacher, with no management role`))

GIVEN `held` IS A `role under §38ג`, `moved to` IS A `role under §38ג`, `years in the roles` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled under §38ג` `held` `moved to` `years in the roles` IF
    `a move §38ג names` `held` `moved to` AND `years in the roles` AT LEAST 8

#ASSERT NOT `a move §38ג names` `a young-division head` `an educational counsellor`

#ASSERT `entitled under §38ג` `a young-division head` `a teacher or a complementing kindergarten teacher, with no management role` 8
#ASSERT `entitled under §38ג` `an educational counsellor` `second deputy or up` 10
#ASSERT NOT `entitled under §38ג` `a young-division head` `a teacher or a complementing kindergarten teacher, with no management role` 7

§§ `28 תיקון סעיף 39 להסכם הכולל`

-- akn:art_28/p1 The lead-in ("in §39 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ב).

-- (א): §39(ב1): a role allowance is paid only while the role is held.
@ref akn:art_28__para_a
GIVEN `holds the role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid the role's allowance` `holds the role` IF
    `holds the role`

-- (ב): §39(ג1): subject to §50(ב)–(ג), a teacher employed in Matia hours
-- gets no homeroom allowance for that employment, though he may for
-- another.
@ref akn:art_28__para_b
GIVEN `the employment is in Matia hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `entitled by §50(ב)–(ג)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a homeroom allowance for the employment` `the employment is in Matia hours` `entitled by §50(ב)–(ג)` IF
    (NOT `the employment is in Matia hours`) OR `entitled by §50(ב)–(ג)`

#ASSERT NOT `a homeroom allowance for the employment` TRUE FALSE

§§ `29 תיקון סעיף 40 להסכם הכולל — גמול ליווי טיולים`

-- §40(ב): instead of §4.ד of the agreement of 8.9.98, the trip allowance is
-- paid in units by the hour the activity ends. "עד 15:00" ends at 15:00
-- (convention thresholds.until) and an hour that closes one row and opens
-- the next is in the row it opens (convention thresholds.shared-bound) —
-- as the circulars of 2023–2026 read the same table.
@ref akn:art_29/p1
GIVEN `ending hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `escort units for an end at` `ending hour` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `ending hour` `is until` 15 THEN 0
        IF `ending hour` `is until` 16 THEN 0.5
        IF `ending hour` `is until` 18 THEN 1.5
        IF `ending hour` `is until` 21 THEN 3
        OTHERWISE 4.5

`the units of a detached activity between 16:00 and 24:00` MEANS 3
`the units of an activity with an overnight stay` MEANS 6.5

#ASSERT `escort units for an end at` 16 EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `escort units for an end at` 14.5 EQUALS 0

-- (ג): the agreement of 8.9.98's other rules go on for teachers on the
-- reform's terms; (ד): the pay of its annex א (escorting on a free day or a
-- day of under 4 hours) is on the reform's substitute-hour value.
`the other rules of the trips agreement of 8.9.98 go on under the reform` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `hours of annex א` IS A NUMBER, `the reform's substitute-hour value` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pay of annex א of the trips agreement` `hours of annex א` `the reform's substitute-hour value` IS
    `hours of annex א` TIMES `the reform's substitute-hour value`

§§ `30 תיקון סעיף 43 להסכם הכולל`

