    `completed the first degree on` `is on or before` (`the school year opening in` `the school year he moved in opens in`)

#ASSERT `academic for the conversion of §43` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2010) 2010

§§ `31 גמול ניהול נגרר וגמול ייעוץ נגרר`

-- akn:art_31 The clause's heading: it names §§44(ב), 65(ג) and 92(ג) and the new §50א; §§43 and 57 below are what amend §§65(ג) and 92(ג).

-- (א): §44(ב)(2) as replaced: a trailing management or counselling
-- allowance is NOT in X, the salary to convert — where the base agreement
-- put it in.
@ref akn:art_31__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the salary to convert, as §44(ב)(2) is replaced` c IF
    (NOT c EQUALS `a trailing management or counselling allowance`) AND `in the salary to convert` c

#ASSERT `in the salary to convert` `a trailing management or counselling allowance`
#ASSERT NOT `in the salary to convert, as §44(ב)(2) is replaced` `a trailing management or counselling allowance`

-- (ב): §50א(א): an existing teacher who had a trailing allowance in the
-- determining month keeps it under the reform, as a shekel supplement: its
-- shekel sum then "multiplied by his conversion coefficient (Y)".
-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-b: Y is an addition in percent (17 to 37, §44(ג)), and X
-- is converted by (100 + Y)%; read as printed the allowance would come to
-- a sixth of itself, or seventeen times itself. The reading adopted
-- (convention reading.consistent): the coefficient converts it as it
-- converts X, by (100 + Y)%, as (ד)(4) below reads "X multiplied by his
-- conversion coefficient".
@ref akn:art_31__para_b
GIVEN `the trailing allowance in the determining month` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the trailing allowance under the reform` `the trailing allowance in the determining month` y IS
    `A, the converted pay` `the trailing allowance in the determining month` y

#ASSERT `the trailing allowance under the reform` 1000 17 EQUALS 1170

-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-b's evidence: Y as printed is not the factor X is
-- converted by.
`Y as printed is not the factor that converts X` MEANS
    (NOT (1000 TIMES 17 EQUALS `A, the converted pay` 1000 17))
    AND (NOT (1000 TIMES 17% EQUALS `A, the converted pay` 1000 17))
#ASSERT `Y as printed is not the factor that converts X`

-- §50א(ב)–(ד): salary for every purpose, but the base of no other
-- percentage supplement; updated with the combined salary; not a role
-- allowance for §39(ב)'s cap of two.
GIVEN p IS A `purpose of a salary component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the trailing allowance counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `the base of percentage supplements`

`the trailing allowance is a role allowance for §39(ב)` MEANS FALSE
`the trailing allowance is updated with the combined salary` MEANS TRUE

-- §50א(ה) and (ה) of the clause: from 1.9.10.
@ref akn:art_31__para_e
`§50א starts on` MEANS `the school year opening in` 2010

-- (ג): an existing teacher who moved in תשס"ח, תשס"ט or תש"ע with a trailing
-- allowance in the determining month is converted again, on the data of
-- his first conversion, from 1.9.10.
@ref akn:art_31__para_c
GIVEN `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER, `had a trailing allowance in the determining month` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `a trailing-allowance reconversion from` `the school year he moved in opens in` `had a trailing allowance in the determining month` IS
    IF      `had a trailing allowance in the determining month`
        AND `the school year he moved in opens in` AT LEAST 2007
        AND `the school year he moved in opens in` AT MOST 2009
    THEN JUST `§50א starts on`
    ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `a trailing-allowance reconversion from` 2008 TRUE EQUALS JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2010)

-- (ד)(1)–(4): one who moved in those years, had the allowance, was placed
-- at grade 9 by the first conversion, and whose X × conversion coefficient
-- was above the grade-9 pay, is compensated (¶2–¶6), for each month from
-- his move to 31.8.09, by the difference times his position that month.
@ref akn:art_31__para_d akn:art_31__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_31__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_31__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_31__para_d__subpara_4
GIVEN `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER, `had a trailing allowance in the determining month` IS A BOOLEAN, `grade by the first conversion` IS A NUMBER, `X with the allowance` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `the grade-9 table pay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the §31(ד) compensation` `the school year he moved in opens in` `had a trailing allowance in the determining month` `grade by the first conversion` `X with the allowance` y `the grade-9 table pay` IF
        `the school year he moved in opens in` AT LEAST 2007
    AND `the school year he moved in opens in` AT MOST 2009
    AND `had a trailing allowance in the determining month`
    AND `grade by the first conversion` EQUALS 9
    AND `A, the converted pay` `X with the allowance` y GREATER THAN `the grade-9 table pay`

@ref akn:art_31__para_d/p2 akn:art_31__para_d/p3 akn:art_31__para_d/p4 akn:art_31__para_d/p5 akn:art_31__para_d/p6
GIVEN `X with the allowance` IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `the grade-9 table pay` IS A NUMBER, `position that month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the §31(ד) compensation for a month` `X with the allowance` y `the grade-9 table pay` `position that month` IS
    `not below zero` (`A, the converted pay` `X with the allowance` y MINUS `the grade-9 table pay`) TIMES `position that month`

`the last month §31(ד) compensates` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2009

#ASSERT `the §31(ד) compensation for a month` 10000 20 11500 1 EQUALS 500

§§ `32 המרה מחודשת למורה אקדמאי — סעיף 46א`

-- akn:art_32 The clause's heading: it names §§44, 70, 96 and 140 and the new §46א; its body amends §§44, 70, 97 and 140 (F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-f).

-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-f's evidence: the heading names §96, the body
-- amends §97, where the words it replaces are printed (§97(א)(4)).
`the base sections §32's heading names` MEANS LIST 44, 70, 96, 140
`the base sections §32's body amends` MEANS LIST 44, 46, 70, 97, 140
`the heading of §32 names §96 where its body amends §97` MEANS
        elem 96 `the base sections §32's heading names`
    AND (NOT elem 96 `the base sections §32's body amends`)
    AND elem 97 `the base sections §32's body amends`
    AND (NOT elem 97 `the base sections §32's heading names`)
#ASSERT `the heading of §32 names §96 where its body amends §97`

-- (א): §44(ב)(5)–(6) are struck out; §46א takes their place.
@ref akn:art_32__para_a
`§44(ב)(5) and (6) apply` MEANS FALSE

-- (ב): §46א(א): an academic teacher who completed a degree or a training
-- allowance between 1 September of the year he moved to the reform and 31
-- December of that school year is converted again: A = X × (Z + 100)% × (Y
-- + 100)% — the conversion of §44(ד) of X × (Z + 100)%. (ב): Z is 6.8 for a
-- first degree to a second, 5.7 for a second to a doctorate, and 0.9 for
-- each unit of a training allowance. (ג): placed on the tables with
-- intermediate grades; (ד): from the day of the entitlement. (ה): one who
-- moved in תשס"ח, also for a completion from 1.1.08 to 31.8.08.
DECLARE `entitlement completed` IS ONE OF
    `a second degree after a first`
    `a doctorate after a second degree`
    `a training allowance` HAS `units completed` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_32__para_b
GIVEN e IS AN `entitlement completed`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Z for an academic teacher` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `a second degree after a first` THEN 6.8
    WHEN `a doctorate after a second degree` THEN 5.7
    WHEN `a training allowance` units THEN 0.9 TIMES units

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, z IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `A of a reconversion` x z y IS
    `A, the converted pay` (x TIMES (100 PLUS z) DIVIDED BY 100) y

GIVEN `an existing teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reconverted under §46א` `an existing teacher` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
        `completed in the first months of the year of the move` TRUE `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`
    OR  (    `the school year he moved in opens in` EQUALS 2007
         AND `completed on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2008)
         AND `completed on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2008))

#ASSERT `A of a reconversion` 10000 (`Z for an academic teacher` `a second degree after a first`) 17 EQUALS 12495.6
#ASSERT `Z for an academic teacher` (`a training allowance` 3) EQUALS 2.7
#ASSERT `reconverted under §46א` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 5 2008) 2007

-- (ג): in §§70 and 97, a principal's and a first deputy's conversion takes
-- §44(ב)(4) and §46א, in place of §44(ב)(4)–(6).
@ref akn:art_32__para_c
`§46א applies to a principal's and a first deputy's conversion` MEANS TRUE

-- (ד): §140(ד1): a kindergarten teacher who completed a degree or a
-- training allowance in the same months is converted again by §46א.
@ref akn:art_32__para_d
GIVEN `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year she moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher reconverted under §46א` `completed on` `the school year she moved in opens in` IF
    `completed in the first months of the year of the move` TRUE `completed on` `the school year she moved in opens in`

§§ `33 סטאטוס להמרה`

-- The end of §44(ג): one who, in the year before his move, was paid a
-- homeroom allowance for Matia hours or as a school's rabbi counts as a
-- homeroom teacher (or homeroom teacher and mother) for the status that
-- sets his conversion coefficient. (§44(ג)'s type of statuses is not named
-- here: base-agreement-140 declares a `status` of its own, and the two
-- clash in one file; the rule takes the facts of the status instead.)
@ref akn:art_33/p1
GIVEN `a mother` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid a homeroom allowance` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid a homeroom allowance for Matia hours or as school rabbi` IS A BOOLEAN, b IS A `position base`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Y by the status for the conversion` `a mother` `paid a homeroom allowance` `paid a homeroom allowance for Matia hours or as school rabbi` b IS
    `Y on a single base`
        (IF `paid a homeroom allowance` OR `paid a homeroom allowance for Matia hours or as school rabbi`
         THEN (IF `a mother` THEN `a homeroom teacher and mother` ELSE `a homeroom teacher`)
         ELSE (IF `a mother` THEN `a mother teacher` ELSE `a regular teacher`))
        b

#ASSERT `Y by the status for the conversion` FALSE FALSE TRUE `the primary base of 30 weekly hours` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `Y by the status for the conversion` TRUE FALSE TRUE `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours` EQUALS 37

§§ `34 המרת שכר למי ששינה תפקיד בשנת המעבר — סעיף 44א`

-- akn:art_34 The clause's heading: it cancels §44(ב)(3) and adds §§44א, 70א and 97א (§§48 and 62 add the last two).

-- (א): §44(ב)(3) is cancelled.
@ref akn:art_34__para_a
`§44(ב)(3) applies` MEANS FALSE

-- (ב): §44א(א): a teacher in another role in the determining month (a
-- principal, a first deputy; a kindergarten teacher goes by §140(ב)): (1)
-- his pay converted as if he stayed in the role; (2) converted again as a
-- teacher, and placed by it; (3) the salary-protection supplement, by
-- §38ב(ב) or (ג) — for a principal or first deputy only on their
-- conditions — with A the pay of (1) that is pensionable, without the role
-- allowances of the old role. (ב): on unpaid leave or another unpaid
-- absence on the eve, both conversions are on the September pay he would
-- have had, without the role allowances that go on.
@ref akn:art_34__para_b
GIVEN `A in the old role, pensionable, without its role allowances` IS A NUMBER, `B as a teacher` IS A NUMBER, `was principal or first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `meets §38ב(ב) or (ג)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the §44א salary-protection supplement` `A in the old role, pensionable, without its role allowances` `B as a teacher` `was principal or first deputy` `meets §38ב(ב) or (ג)` IS
    IF `was principal or first deputy` AND NOT `meets §38ב(ב) or (ג)`
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the salary-protection supplement` `A in the old role, pensionable, without its role allowances` `B as a teacher`

DECLARE `month a converted pay is taken from` IS ONE OF
    `the determining month`
    `September of the year of the move, as if employed`

GIVEN `on unpaid leave or another unpaid absence on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `month a converted pay is taken from`
DECIDE `the month a §44א conversion is taken from` `on unpaid leave or another unpaid absence on the eve` IS
    IF `on unpaid leave or another unpaid absence on the eve`
    THEN `September of the year of the move, as if employed`
    ELSE `the determining month`

