§§ `37 החלפת סעיף 50 להסכם הכולל — גמולי תפקיד למורה קיים`

-- §50(א): after the conversion, §§39–42 apply to an existing academic
-- teacher.
@ref akn:art_37/p1
GIVEN `converted under part ח` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§§39 to 42 apply after the conversion` `converted under part ח` IF
    `converted under part ח`

-- §50(ב): one paid a homeroom allowance for Matia hours in the year before
-- his move keeps a homeroom allowance while continuously employed in Matia
-- hours: at least 9 a week in a primary school, 8 in a junior high.
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Matia hours a homeroom allowance asks at least` stage IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school` THEN 9 ELSE 8

-- §50(ג)–(ד): the continuity breaks once (1) unpaid leave (a sabbatical
-- included) lasts more than a school year, (2) more than a school year
-- without Matia hours or below (ב)'s, or (3) the two together more than a
-- school year in a row — save (1) or (3) while he was paid a homeroom
-- allowance.
GIVEN `school years on unpaid leave in a row` IS A NUMBER, `school years without enough Matia hours in a row` IS A NUMBER, `school years of either in a row` IS A NUMBER, `paid a homeroom allowance in that time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `continuously employed in Matia hours` `school years on unpaid leave in a row` `school years without enough Matia hours in a row` `school years of either in a row` `paid a homeroom allowance in that time` IF
        `school years without enough Matia hours in a row` AT MOST 1
    AND (   `paid a homeroom allowance in that time`
         OR (`school years on unpaid leave in a row` AT MOST 1 AND `school years of either in a row` AT MOST 1))

GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`, `weekly Matia hours` IS A NUMBER, `continuously employed` IS A BOOLEAN, `paid it in the year before the move` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a homeroom allowance for Matia hours` stage `weekly Matia hours` `continuously employed` `paid it in the year before the move` IF
        `paid it in the year before the move`
    AND `continuously employed`
    AND `weekly Matia hours` AT LEAST `the Matia hours a homeroom allowance asks at least` stage

#ASSERT `a homeroom allowance for Matia hours` `a junior high school` 8 TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `continuously employed in Matia hours` 1.5 0 1.5 FALSE
#ASSERT `continuously employed in Matia hours` 1.5 0 1.5 TRUE

§§ `38 הוספת סעיף 53א להסכם הכולל — מעבר בין טבלאות למורה לא אקדמאי`

-- §53א(1): an existing non-academic teacher entitled to another table on
-- completing a non-academic level keeps his seniority and grade there; (ב):
-- not one who completed it between 1 September of the year of his move and
-- 31 December of that school year — §55א applies to him.
@ref akn:art_38/p1
GIVEN `grade` IS A NUMBER, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `grade and seniority on the next non-academic table` `grade` `seniority` IS
    LIST `grade`, `seniority`

GIVEN `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§53א applies` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
    NOT `completed in the first months of the year of the move` TRUE `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`

#ASSERT `grade and seniority on the next non-academic table` 3 12 EQUALS LIST 3, 12

§§ `39 תיקון סעיף 55 להסכם הכולל — המרה למורה קיים לא אקדמאי`

-- (א)(1)–(2): §55 converts a non-academic teacher by §§44, 44א and 45
-- (not §44 alone), "with the changes and adjustments below".
@ref akn:art_39__para_a akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_39__para_a__subpara_2
`the sections a non-academic teacher is converted by` MEANS LIST "44", "44א", "45"

-- (ב): §55(ב): a level (an uncertified teacher certified, say) or a
-- training allowance completed between March of the year before the move
-- and the opening of the school year of the move counts in X.
-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-l: §55א (§40 below) runs from that same
-- opening day, so as printed 1 September is in both — counted in X and
-- reconverted for. The reading adopted (convention
-- thresholds.shared-bound): the day belongs to the period that opens on it,
-- §55א's; §55(ב)'s ends the day before.
@ref akn:art_39__para_b
GIVEN `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X, as printed` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
        `completed on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 (`the school year he moved in opens in` MINUS 1))
    AND `completed on` `is on or before` (`the school year opening in` `the school year he moved in opens in`)

GIVEN `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
        `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X, as printed` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`
    AND NOT `completed in the first months of the year of the move` TRUE `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`

#ASSERT `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 7 2010) 2010
#ASSERT NOT `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X` (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 2 2009) 2010
#ASSERT NOT `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X` (`the school year opening in` 2010) 2010

-- F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-l's evidence: a completion on 1 September of
-- the year of the move is in §55(ב)'s window and in §55א's, as printed.
`1 September is in §55(ב)'s window and in §55א's` MEANS
        `a completion counts in a non-academic teacher's X, as printed` (`the school year opening in` 2010) 2010
    AND `completed in the first months of the year of the move` TRUE (`the school year opening in` 2010) 2010
#ASSERT `1 September is in §55(ב)'s window and in §55א's`

§§ `40 המרה מחודשת למורה קיים לא אקדמאי — סעיף 55א`

-- akn:art_40 The clause's heading: it adds §55א.

-- (א): §55א: an existing non-academic teacher who completed a level or a
-- training allowance between 1 September of the year of the move and 31
-- December of that year is converted again, A = X × (Z + 100)% × (Y +
-- 100)%; Z: 6.7 certified to senior, 11.6 uncertified to certified, 20.0
-- uncertified to senior, 0.9 a unit of training allowance. Placed on the
-- tables with intermediate grades "המצורפות להסכם הכולל כנספחים ______"
-- (F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-h); from the day of the entitlement; one who moved in
-- תשס"ח, also for a completion from 1.1.08 to 31.8.08.
DECLARE `non-academic entitlement completed` IS ONE OF
    `certified to senior`
    `uncertified to certified`
    `uncertified to senior`
    `a non-academic training allowance` HAS `non-academic units completed` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_40__para_a
GIVEN e IS A `non-academic entitlement completed`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Z for a non-academic teacher` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `certified to senior` THEN 6.7
    WHEN `uncertified to certified` THEN 11.6
    WHEN `uncertified to senior` THEN 20.0
    WHEN `a non-academic training allowance` units THEN 0.9 TIMES units

#ASSERT `A of a reconversion` 8000 (`Z for a non-academic teacher` `uncertified to senior`) 10 EQUALS 10560

-- §55א(א), (ה): the window is §46א's — 1 September to 31 December of the
-- school year of the move, and for one who moved in תשס"ח also 1.1.08 to
-- 31.8.08 (1 September itself: F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-l, §39 above).
GIVEN `completed on` IS A DATE, `the school year he moved in opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reconverted under §55א` `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in` IF
    `reconverted under §46א` TRUE `completed on` `the school year he moved in opens in`

#ASSERT `reconverted under §55א` (`the school year opening in` 2010) 2010

-- (ב)–(ג): in §79 (principals) and §108 (first deputies) "with the change"
-- becomes "with the changes", and a non-academic one's reconversion is by
-- §55א in place of §46א (and §108 converts by §97, not §70).
@ref akn:art_40__para_b akn:art_40__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_40__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_40__para_c akn:art_40__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_40__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_40__para_c__subpara_3
GIVEN `academic` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reconversion section for a manager` `academic` IS
    IF `academic` THEN "46א" ELSE "55א"

`a non-academic first deputy is converted by §97` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `the reconversion section for a manager` FALSE EQUALS "55א"

§§ `41 תיקון סעיף 59 להסכם הכולל — הפרשי שכר`

-- akn:art_41 The clause's heading ("amending §59 — arrears").
-- akn:art_41/p2 The lead-in ("in §59 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ב).

DECLARE `table an arrears is computed on` IS ONE OF
    `the combined table he was placed on at the move`
    `the combined table he was on when promoted`

DECLARE `arrears of §59` IS ONE OF
    `arrears for the conversion coefficient`
    `arrears for a grade promotion`

-- §59(א): the arrears for the coefficient are on the table he was placed on
-- when he moved to the reform, though he later went up to another
-- non-academic table; §59(ב): those for a grade, on the table he was on on
-- the day of the promotion. §§53 and 68 below say the same for §85
-- (principals) and §114 (first deputies).
@ref akn:art_41__para_a akn:art_41__para_b
GIVEN a IS AN `arrears of §59`
GIVETH A `table an arrears is computed on`
DECIDE `the table the arrears are computed on` a IS
    IF a EQUALS `arrears for the conversion coefficient`
    THEN `the combined table he was placed on at the move`
    ELSE `the combined table he was on when promoted`

#ASSERT `the table the arrears are computed on` `arrears for a grade promotion` EQUALS `the combined table he was on when promoted`

