-- akn:art_45/p1 The lead-in ("in §66 of the base agreement:"); the amendments are (א)–(ב).

-- (א): §66(ו) names farms and marine centres beside Pais clusters and Pisga
-- centres.
@ref akn:art_45__para_a
`§66(ו) reaches agricultural farms and marine centres` MEANS TRUE

-- (ב): §66(י1): a farm's or marine centre's level by its standard hours
-- allotted by the Ministry: up to 175, 1; 176–225, 2; 226 and up, 3. The
-- rows count whole hours, and the second opens at 176, so 175 is in the
-- first (as §66 reads "עד 280" beside "גדול מ-280"); an hour between 175
-- and 176 is in the row that opens above it.
@ref akn:art_45__para_b
GIVEN `standard hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
