§§ `79 המרת שכר לגננות`

-- akn:art_79/p1 The lead-in ("in §140 of the base agreement:").

-- (א): §140(ב)–(ג) as replaced: (ב) one who in the year before her move
-- was a kindergarten teacher, or both, and in the year of the move is a
-- teacher alone, is converted as a teacher; (ג) one who was both and in the
-- year of the move is a kindergarten teacher alone, or both: Y = (her Y as
-- a teacher, §44(ג)) × S + (her Y as a kindergarten teacher, §140) × H, H
-- and S her shares of her whole actual position in each, even above 100%.
