DECIDE `Y of a teacher and kindergarten teacher` `Y as a teacher` `share as a teacher` `share as a kindergarten teacher` IS
        `Y as a teacher` TIMES `share as a teacher`
    PLUS `a kindergarten teacher's conversion coefficient Y` TIMES 100 TIMES `share as a kindergarten teacher`

#ASSERT `Y of a teacher and kindergarten teacher` 20 0.5 0.5 EQUALS 18

