§§ `82 מנהלות אשכולות גנים`

-- §144א: (א) a kindergarten cluster manager's position base is 34 weekly
-- hours; (ב) full position only; (ג) her week by the number of kindergartens
-- in the cluster, from 4 to 10, the hours with the children falling by 2
-- and the management hours rising by 2 for each further kindergarten. The
-- table has no row for fewer than 4 or more than 10 (F-ofek-hadash-hashlama-2012-j),
-- and gives none (convention thresholds.missing-row).
@ref akn:art_82/p1
`a kindergarten cluster manager's position base` MEANS 34
`a kindergarten cluster manager's position` MEANS 1

@desc A kindergarten cluster manager's week of 34 hours.
DECLARE `cluster manager's week` HAS
    `hours with the children`     IS A NUMBER @desc frontal and guidance or enrichment hours with the kindergarten's children
    `hours managing the cluster`  IS A NUMBER

GIVEN kindergartens IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `cluster manager's week`
DECIDE `a kindergarten cluster manager's week` kindergartens IS
    IF kindergartens AT LEAST 4 AND kindergartens AT MOST 10
    THEN JUST (`cluster manager's week` WITH
                   `hours with the children`    IS 34 MINUS 2 TIMES kindergartens
                   `hours managing the cluster` IS 2 TIMES kindergartens)
    ELSE NOTHING

GIVEN w IS A `cluster manager's week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of a cluster manager's week` w IS
    w's `hours with the children` PLUS w's `hours managing the cluster`

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE `cluster manager's week`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `hours with the children in` m IS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST w THEN JUST (w's `hours with the children`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE `cluster manager's week`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `hours of the week in` m IS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST w THEN JUST (`hours of a cluster manager's week` w)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

`the cluster week rows the table prints` MEANS LIST 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10
`the hours with the children the table prints` MEANS LIST 26, 24, 22, 20, 18, 16, 14
`the cluster week table has no row below 4 or above 10` MEANS
    (NOT elem 3 `the cluster week rows the table prints`) AND (NOT elem 11 `the cluster week rows the table prints`)
#ASSERT `the cluster week table has no row below 4 or above 10`
#ASSERT map (GIVEN k YIELD `hours with the children in` (`a kindergarten cluster manager's week` k)) `the cluster week rows the table prints` EQUALS map (GIVEN h YIELD JUST h) `the hours with the children the table prints`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN k YIELD `hours of the week in` (`a kindergarten cluster manager's week` k) EQUALS JUST `a kindergarten cluster manager's position base`) `the cluster week rows the table prints`
#ASSERT `a kindergarten cluster manager's week` 3 EQUALS NOTHING

-- §144ב: her tables are §§136–137's. §144ג: (א) the cluster-management
-- allowance is 13% of the combined salary; (ב) the State acts to have it
-- recognised as a fixed supplement for the pensions law, with
-- accrual-pension contributions on it; (ג) study-fund contributions; (ד)
-- one with a trailing allowance gets the higher of the two.
`the cluster-management allowance rate` MEANS 13%

GIVEN `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `the trailing allowance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cluster-management allowance` `combined salary` `the trailing allowance` IS
    max (`the cluster-management allowance rate` TIMES `combined salary`) `the trailing allowance`

`recognising the cluster-management allowance for pension` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to recognise the cluster-management allowance as a fixed supplement for the pensions law`

#ASSERT `the cluster-management allowance` 10000 0 EQUALS 1300

-- §144ד (inside the part §82 adds, though printed after the quotation
-- closes: convention instruments.quotation-extent): her pay is converted by
-- §140, with Y of 26% — §140's 16% and 10 more.
`a kindergarten cluster manager's conversion coefficient Y` MEANS 26%
#ASSERT `a kindergarten cluster manager's conversion coefficient Y` EQUALS `a kindergarten teacher's conversion coefficient Y` PLUS 10%

